   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2020-08-27",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Recycling and Waste Reduction (Consequential and Transitional Provisions) Bill 2020 repeals the Product Stewardship Act 2011 and transitions its provisions into the new Recycling and Waste Reduction Bill 2020, ensuring continuity for existing schemes like the National Television and Computer Recycling Scheme without disruption to industry or the public."
  },
